    <string name="perf_warning_title">These profiles may make your tablet unstable</string>
    <string name="perf_warning_body">They run the processor and graphics faster than Qualcomm rates this chip for. The tablet can get hot, apps can close, and it can restart by itself. If it restarts by itself within 3 minutes of starting, Performance switches back to Max.</string>

